OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after pedestrian hit by car
OL,4,Aand killed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian was killed when he was a hit
OL,8,Fby a car.
OL,10,FIsmail Mohammed, 68, died after he was
OL,11,Fstruck by the vehicle on Stratford
OL,12,FRoad, in Hall Green, Birmingham, at
OL,13,Fabout 20:45 BST on Thursday.
OL,15,FA 45-year-old man was arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,17,Fdriving "after urgent inquiries", and
OL,18,Fhad since been bailed pending further
OL,19,Finvestigation, West Midlands Police
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
