OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after pedestrian hit by car
OL,4,Aand killed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute, Mohammed's family said he
OL,7,F"gave so much love to his family,
OL,8,Ffriends, his community and anyone that
OL,9,Fever met him".
